    (∀ (x y : α), Q x y → ¬ends x ∧ ends y) →
      ∀ {a c : α}, Becoming.«及» (ch.withPairs Q).Shown a c → Becoming.«及» ch.Shown a c ∨ ends c
@Becoming.ChoiceOccasions.noCycle_withPairs_of_kept : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {O : Type u_2}
